
== Interface Overview

The Kauhale On-Line Eligibility Assistance (KOLEA) System is the system of record
for medical application and eligibility information. KOLEA interfaces with a number of
other services and systems, sharing information to verify data and complete eligibility
determinations. MQD contracts an Application System Integrator (ASI) to maintain and
operate KOLEA on its behalf.

